<!-- title: Research | active: research | desc: Research on cancer genomics, tumor evolution, clonal architecture, and computational methods. -->
<h2>Research</h2>
<p>I build and apply computational methods to understand how cancers arise, evolve, and respond to treatment. Much of this work is grounded in acute myeloid leukemia (AML) but extends across many tumor types and into immunotherapy design.</p>
