<h4 class="research-title">Genomic origins of tumorigenesis</h4>
<p class="research-desc">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. We use whole-genome and exome sequencing to catalog the somatic mutations, structural variants, and epigenetic changes that initiate and sustain malignant transformation, with an emphasis on myeloid disease.</p>
</div>
